<title>USA: Genzyme General Q1 diluted net rises.</title>
<headline>Genzyme General Q1 diluted net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.27		    $0.27</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.27		     0.26</p>
<p> Net			 21,238		   19,034</p>
<p> Revs		     144,606		  111,783</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	78,237		   71,382</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	78,238		   74,192</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Net refers to net income attributable to Genzyme General stock.</p>
<p>Q1 operating income rose 21 percent to $27.4 million vs $22.6 million for Q1 1996, despite $4 million decline in R&amp;D revenue and $2 million increase in amortization expenses due to DSP acquisition.</p>
<p>Genzyme General is a division of Genzyme Corp that has its own common stock.</p>
</text>
